*
!.gitignore

# Uploads belong to whoever runs the site, so they stay out of the repo.
#
# These two directories are the exception: they hold the placeholder client
# logos and sample cover images generated by scripts/build-sample-client-logos.mjs
# and scripts/build-sample-covers.mjs. They are review scaffolding, and a
# staging deploy that shows dashed "Client logo" boxes is not much of a review,
# so they ship with the repo.
#
# Delete both directories, and the rows that point at them, before launch —
# see docs/placeholders.md §7. Anything the client uploads through the admin
# lands in sibling directories and stays ignored.
!clients/
!clients/*.png
!covers/
!covers/*.png
